    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "1.  Learned counsel appearing for the petitioners prays for liberty to withdraw the present writ petition since admittedly the 'Khasra' numbers mentioned in the petition do not find mention in the Award, dated 23.03.1993 (Annexure P-3), passed by the authorities, under the Land Acquisition Land, 1894.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 714,
      "end": 1017,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "23.03.1993",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 925,
          "end": 935
        },
        {
          "text": "Land Acquisition Land, 1894",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 989,
          "end": 1016
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Therefore, the argument raised that now it should be released under Section 101-A of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013 would be a stumbling block.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1018,
      "end": 1241,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 101-A",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1086,
          "end": 1099
        },
        {
          "text": "Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1107,
          "end": 1213
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "2. Dismissed as withdrawn with liberty to file a fresh petition with better particulars.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1242,
      "end": 1331,
